<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 51pt; text-align: justify;">This Officer&#8217;s Certificate (&#8220;<b>Certificate</b>&#8221;) is being delivered pursuant to <u>Section 8(e)</u> of that certain Securities Purchase Agreement dated as of _________ [ ], 2025, (&#8220;<b>Purchase Agreement</b>&#8221;), by and between<b> CBDMD</b><b>, INC.</b>, a North Carolina corporation (the &#8220;<b>Company</b>&#8221;), and <b>C/M CAPITAL MASTER FUND, LP </b>(the &#8220;<b>Investor</b>&#8221;). Capitalized terms used herein and not otherwise defined shall have the respective meanings ascribed to them in the Purchase Agreement.</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 51pt; text-align: justify;">The undersigned, Chief Executive Officer, ______________ of the Company, hereby certifies, on behalf of the Company and not in his individual capacity, as follows:</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I am the Chief Executive Officer of the Company and make the statements contained in this Certificate;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>

